          "description": "Detect the molecule gallery stand to open a gallery of CO2, BF3, CH4, NH3, H2O, PF5, SF6, and XeF4. Compare Lewis structures, steric numbers, electron-domain geometries, and molecular geometries. Learning objective: apply VSEPR predictions to real molecules and compare predicted shapes with observed structures."
        },
